      "source_ref": "body.p1089",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1089"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-3ae4a77dfe3156fb16aedc95",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "时间相关性：试验用药品和不良事件出现的有无合理的时间关系；",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的评估",
        "不良事件因果关系判断"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1090"
      ],
